## Phase 1 — Release pipeline hardening → `feat/release-hardening`

- [ ] **ghcr visibility** — make `ghcr.io/mozebaltyk/uponlan` public, or document `podman login ghcr.io` as a deploy prerequisite.
- [ ] **Tag-triggered releases** — `image.yml`/`release.yml` on `push: tags: 'v*'` instead of manual `workflow_dispatch`.
- [ ] **`assets.yml` per-OS target** — a `target` input to release one bundle without the full multi-GB mirror.
- [ ] **Drop the stale committed `release/assets/endpoints.yml`** — netboot-era `releases/download/` catalog; the pipeline reads the generated one.

## Phase 2 — Menu/asset content → `feat/asset-content`

- [ ] **Rocky Linux local recipe** — last entry still booting `download.rockylinux.org` directly (`release/assets/rockylinux/setting.sh`).
- [ ] **Cloud-init assets** — with a "category" column in the Assets tab.

## Phase 3 — Webapp features → `feat/webapp-features`

- [ ] **Console: multi-host KVM** — add a KVM host entry + connect to remote hosts over SSH (key-based), not just local `qemu:///system`.
- [ ] **Console: attach disks** — allow disks on the test VM so PXE can run a real install, not just a diskless boot.
- [ ] **Wake-on-LAN** — show host status/IP + add a scheduler.

## Phase 4 — Platform hardening → `feat/platform-hardening`

- [ ] **HTTPS** — TLS termination (reverse proxy or in-nginx certs) for webapp + asset serving (plain HTTP 8080/3000 today).
- [ ] **Kubernetes** — promote the chart's Pod → Deployment (replicas 1); rework node-local `hostPort` TFTP + `hostPath` libvirt socket.
- [ ] **Update Node.js** — the container pins an older runtime.

## Phase 5 — Polish → `chore/polish`

- [ ] **Prose brand sweep** — "UpOnLAN" → "UpOnLAN.xyz" in body text (titles/folder already done).
- [ ] **Docs** — ghcr login note + any remaining release/deploy gaps.